msgid "%(path)s says which record this is -- giving it a typed value would make a different record, not a patched one."
msgstr "%(path)s 表明这是哪条记录 -- 给它一个类型化的值会使其变成另一条记录, 而非补丁记录。"

msgid "Define a value"
msgstr "定义值"

msgid "Type a value for %(path)s. It is written to the patch exactly as given, in the field's own type.\nYour mods are not modified."
msgstr "为 %(path)s 输入一个值。它会按给定原样以字段的类型写入补丁。\n你的模组不会被更改。"

msgid "currently: %(val)s  (%(kind)s)"
msgstr "当前: %(val)s  (%(kind)s)"

msgid "keeping unnamed bits: %(bits)s"
msgstr "保留未命名的位: %(bits)s"

msgid "Enabled (true)"
msgstr "已启用 (true)"

msgid "Set value"
msgstr "设置值"

msgid "Building the conflict map..."
msgstr "正在构建冲突地图…"

msgid "The conflict map could not be built."
msgstr "无法构建冲突地图。"

msgid "Could not build conflict map"
msgstr "无法构建冲突地图"

msgid "%(error)s"
msgstr "%(error)s"

msgid "Conflict map ready (%(cells)d cell(s))."
msgstr "冲突地图已就绪 (单元格 %(cells)d 个)。"

msgid "Conflict Map"
msgstr "冲突地图"

msgid "Could not write the page"
msgstr "无法写入页面"

msgid "Writing %(path)s failed: %(error)s"
msgstr "写入 %(path)s 失败: %(error)s"

msgid "Saved, but could not open a viewer"
msgstr "已保存，但无法打开查看器"

msgid "The page was written to %(path)s (%(error)s)"
msgstr "页面已写入 %(path)s (%(error)s)"

msgid "Could not build the view"
msgstr "无法构建视图"

msgid "Nothing to compare"
msgstr "没有可比较的内容"

msgid "Only one plugin edits this cell's terrain, so every strategy gives the same result. Strategy choice only matters where two or more plugins change the same ground."
msgstr "只有一个插件编辑此单元格的地形, 因此每种策略都给出相同结果。策略选择只有在两个或更多插件更改同一地面时才重要。"

msgid "Merged: %(s)s"
msgstr "已合并: %(s)s"

msgid "Format reference..."
msgstr "格式参考…"

msgid "Show what this kind of record is supposed to contain: every subrecord, whether the game requires it, how wide it is, and -- where the layout is documented -- the named fields inside it.\n\nA diff tells you what changed; this tells you what it was."
msgstr "显示这种记录应包含什么: 每个子记录、游戏是否需要它、其宽度, 以及 -- 在结构有文档记录的地方 -- 其中的命名字段。\n\n差异告诉你什么变了; 这告诉你它曾是什么。"

msgid "Read as dialogue..."
msgstr "作为对话读取…"

msgid "Show this record as the line an NPC says -- to whom, and under what conditions -- instead of raw subrecords. Each plugin's version is rendered in turn, so you can read what a conflict actually changes."
msgstr "将此记录显示为 NPC 所说的台词 -- 对谁说、在什么条件下 -- 而非原始子记录。每个插件的版本依次渲染, 让你读出冲突实际改变了什么。"

msgid "Dialogue"
msgstr "对话"

msgid "(no dialogue content)"
msgstr "(无对话内容)"

msgid "Format reference: %(type)s"
msgstr "格式参考: %(type)s"

msgid "Show graph..."
msgstr "显示图…"

msgid "Draw the path grid as a navigation graph, with the edges this plugin added in green and the ones it removed in red.\n\nA mod that only REMOVES edges has probably rebuilt its path grid by accident -- that breaks NPC movement and nothing else reports it."
msgstr "将路径网格绘制为导航图, 此插件添加的边为绿色, 移除的边为红色。\n\n只「移除」边的模组很可能意外重建了它的路径网格 -- 这会破坏 NPC 移动, 而其他任何东西都不会报告。"

msgid "Show difference..."
msgstr "显示差异…"

msgid "Decode both versions to absolute heights and subtract them: red where the winner raised the ground, blue where it lowered it.\n\nComparing the raw values above is misleading. Heights are stored as cumulative deltas, so moving ONE vertex changes every byte after it and two nearly-identical cells look completely different."
msgstr "将两个版本解码为绝对高度并相减: 胜者抬高地面处为红色, 降低处为蓝色。\n\n比较上方的原始值会产生误导。高度以累积增量存储, 因此移动「一个」顶点会改变之后的每个字节, 使两个几乎相同的单元格看起来完全不同。"

msgid "Show in 3D..."
msgstr "在 3D 中显示…"

msgid "Draw the cell's terrain as a surface you can rotate, with each plugin's version switchable in place. Drag to turn it.\n\nShading follows slope rather than height, which reads as terrain."
msgstr "将单元格的地形绘制为一个可旋转的表面, 每个插件的版本可就地切换。拖动以旋转。\n\n着色遵循坡度, 更易读作地形。"

msgid "Compare strategies..."
msgstr "比较策略…"

msgid "Show what each conflict strategy would do to this cell -- the merged terrain under Overwrite, Resolve, Ignore and Curvature, switchable in the same 3D view alongside each plugin's own version.\n\nPreview it here, then set the strategy you want in the plugin's .mergedlands.toml with Merge Settings. Only differs where two or more plugins actually contest a vertex."
msgstr "显示每种冲突策略对此单元格会做什么 -- Overwrite、Resolve、Ignore 和 Curvature 下的合并地形, 在同一 3D 视图中在每个插件版本旁切换。\n\n在此预览, 然后通过合并设置在插件的 .mergedlands.toml 中设置所需策略。只有在两个或更多插件确实争夺某个顶点处才会有差异。"

msgid "View mesh..."
msgstr "查看网格…"

msgid "Open the mesh this record points at in the 3D viewer, resolved through your data folders and .bsa archives. One per plugin, so a record whose plugins point at different meshes shows them side by side -- the same viewer the Resource Conflicts window uses."
msgstr "在 3D 查看器中打开此记录指向的网格, 通过你的数据文件夹和 .bsa 存档解析。每个插件一个, 因此各插件指向不同网格的记录会并排显示它们 -- 与资源冲突窗口相同的查看器。"

msgid "View image..."
msgstr "查看图像…"

msgid "Open the texture/icon this record points at, resolved through your data folders and .bsa archives, and compared across the plugins that define it -- the same image viewer the Resource Conflicts window uses."
msgstr "打开此记录指向的纹理/图标, 通过你的数据文件夹和 .bsa 存档解析, 并在定义它的插件之间比较 -- 与资源冲突窗口相同的图像查看器。"

msgid "Queue the whole record from a plugin you pick, then open the patch builder."
msgstr "从你选择的插件将整条记录加入队列, 然后打开补丁构建器。"

msgid "Take this field..."
msgstr "获取此字段…"

msgid "Queue just this field from a plugin you pick -- the rest of the record keeps the load-order winner. For when one mod fixed the script and another retextured the mesh."
msgstr "从你选择的插件仅将此字段加入队列 -- 记录的其余部分保留加载顺序的胜者。适用于一个模组修复了脚本而另一个重新贴图了网格的情况。"

