msgstr "我的模组 (上次排序)"

msgid "Add every custom mod from the last Sort whose file could be located (curated plugins are the list's job, not yours)."
msgstr "添加上次排序中所有能定位到文件的自定义模组 (精选插件是列表的事情, 而非你的事情)。"

